WEBVTT

00:00:13.340 --> 00:00:14.960
Hideyoshi...

00:00:35.030 --> 00:00:37.990
The fate that will befall those who defy me...

00:00:38.080 --> 00:00:40.740
For the sake of my reign
to come over this country,

00:00:40.830 --> 00:00:44.120
I will take your head and
make an example of you.

00:00:57.010 --> 00:01:01.470
It appears you have risen above the
little snake who did little but bluster.

00:01:01.560 --> 00:01:04.520
However, no matter
how many swords you wield,

00:01:04.600 --> 00:01:08.590
even at your best, you will
ultimately be powerless before me.

00:01:08.690 --> 00:01:10.520
Don't get me wrong.

00:01:10.610 --> 00:01:13.770
I've got little hope of
having a fun party with you.

00:01:14.490 --> 00:01:16.400
It's a party I can't get into,

00:01:16.490 --> 00:01:19.450
which means, the faster
I get it over with the better!

00:01:26.420 --> 00:01:27.910
I see.

00:01:28.000 --> 00:01:31.410
So he said that, did he?

00:01:31.500 --> 00:01:34.210
Told me to stay put.

00:01:34.300 --> 00:01:36.960
Should Uesugi be in peril, go to Utsunomiya.

00:01:37.050 --> 00:01:40.920
If Date is pressed hard,
send reinforcements to Odawara.

00:01:41.010 --> 00:01:43.720
Should the mobile fortress appear in the west

00:01:43.810 --> 00:01:46.550
in the hands of Mori or
possibly the Toyotomi,

00:01:46.640 --> 00:01:50.350
please know that I have met my end there.

00:01:50.440 --> 00:01:51.680
However,

00:01:51.770 --> 00:01:55.390
I shall not allow my departure upon
this journey to be our final farewell.

00:01:55.490 --> 00:01:59.230
I swear upon the souls of
Master Oyamada and those I have lost

00:01:59.320 --> 00:02:02.280
that I shall carry out my mission, without fail!

00:02:02.370 --> 00:02:04.860
I most heartily understand.

00:02:06.410 --> 00:02:12.630
So, Yukimura has finally found it
within himself to make use of me.

00:02:12.710 --> 00:02:15.950
I have been waiting for this moment.

00:02:16.050 --> 00:02:20.290
But of all things, to tell me to stay put!

00:02:24.890 --> 00:02:28.260
Yukimura! And One-Eyed Dragon!

00:02:28.350 --> 00:02:32.350
Overcome this ordeal with your young strength

00:02:32.440 --> 00:02:35.060
and fully accomplish
what you have set out to do!

00:02:45.830 --> 00:02:47.070
Lord Mori!

00:02:47.160 --> 00:02:50.000
There is an army waiting for us up ahead!

00:02:50.080 --> 00:02:52.740
Their banner indicates they are of Satsuma!

00:02:52.840 --> 00:02:54.540
Eliminate them.

00:03:06.930 --> 00:03:08.550
Fire!

00:03:28.330 --> 00:03:31.070
Sanada Genjiro Yukimura of the Takeda Army!

00:03:31.160 --> 00:03:32.750
Lord Mori Motonari!

00:03:32.830 --> 00:03:36.580
On behalf of Takeda Shingen, Tiger of Kai,

00:03:36.670 --> 00:03:37.880
and with words of enlightenment

00:03:37.960 --> 00:03:40.250
from Lord Shimazu Yoshihiro
of Satsuma in my heart,

00:03:40.340 --> 00:03:43.800
I have come to stop your invasion of Osaka!

00:03:47.720 --> 00:03:50.090
And here, I was wondering
whose sacrificial pawn you might be.

00:03:50.180 --> 00:03:53.600
But you are the Takeda general,
who treated his men like sacrificial pawns

00:03:53.690 --> 00:03:55.890
even more than I did at Itsukushima.

00:03:55.980 --> 00:03:58.470
I did not think that you were still alive.

00:03:58.570 --> 00:04:01.730
The Toyotomi and the Mori give no
thought to the future of the people

00:04:01.820 --> 00:04:04.230
and they betray one another,
even as they formed an alliance.

00:04:04.320 --> 00:04:07.240
I will not let the country
fall into either of your hands!

00:04:07.330 --> 00:04:10.860
Truly, an interruption making
a nuisance of yourself to others.

00:04:10.950 --> 00:04:11.780
Be gone.

00:04:11.870 --> 00:04:14.240
I have no interest in you.

00:05:13.770 --> 00:05:15.380
I see.

00:05:15.480 --> 00:05:18.140
So you and I are different.

00:05:19.560 --> 00:05:21.560
The engraving on your sword

00:05:21.650 --> 00:05:24.860
is not the noble vow of a second-in-command.

00:05:24.950 --> 00:05:29.610
Its purpose is to seal away the
brutality that hides deep within you.

00:05:29.700 --> 00:05:32.570
Prepare to meet your fate, Takenaka Hanbei.

00:05:32.660 --> 00:05:34.950
I'll give you time enough for that.

00:05:37.170 --> 00:05:39.910
After all that I have seen, my
life is of no consequence to me.

00:05:40.000 --> 00:05:41.080
It's just that...

00:05:41.170 --> 00:05:43.960
...I have no life to offer up to you!

00:05:51.640 --> 00:05:55.430
Are you now aware of your
own quality, One-Eyed Dragon?

00:05:55.520 --> 00:06:00.810
If your one eye can see how this
country walks down the path of ruin,

00:06:00.900 --> 00:06:04.260
at least strike a blow in return.

00:06:05.150 --> 00:06:08.900
If you would howl, then show that
you have the strength to match it.

00:06:08.990 --> 00:06:13.150
The country that I give shape to
has no need of those who are weak.

00:06:13.240 --> 00:06:17.860
Those who lack strength,
I will merely crush with my fists!

00:06:17.960 --> 00:06:20.870
Hah! Give me a break!

00:06:20.960 --> 00:06:26.450
Under your rule, only
soldiers will have a place to live.

00:06:26.550 --> 00:06:30.260
That which is indispensible
in ruling a country...

00:06:30.340 --> 00:06:31.880
...is strength!

00:06:37.770 --> 00:06:39.380
Number One!

00:06:39.810 --> 00:06:43.930
This weak country suffers a malady and I...

00:06:44.020 --> 00:06:47.770
...my Toyotomi Army will sweep it away!

00:07:08.630 --> 00:07:10.920
Are you Uesugi Kenshin?

00:07:11.010 --> 00:07:12.340
Indeed.

00:07:12.430 --> 00:07:14.840
What is your name?

00:07:14.930 --> 00:07:18.170
Ishida Mitsunari of the Toyotomi Army.

00:07:19.230 --> 00:07:21.590
Under Lord Hideyoshi's authority,

00:07:21.690 --> 00:07:24.720
I will destroy you!

00:07:24.820 --> 00:07:26.930
Simple and pure of heart.

00:07:27.030 --> 00:07:29.110
To the point that it pains me.

00:07:32.780 --> 00:07:34.400
Lord Kenshin!

00:07:38.660 --> 00:07:40.280
How swift!

00:07:42.710 --> 00:07:44.320
Take that!

00:07:48.130 --> 00:07:50.460
Once we've beat all these guys to a pulp,

00:07:50.550 --> 00:07:52.790
you're dueling me, Gramps!

00:07:52.880 --> 00:07:56.250
I know! This's nothin' but a warm up!

00:08:01.430 --> 00:08:05.100
Ya did well! Ya just rest there now!

00:08:07.820 --> 00:08:11.980
I'm glad we didn't have to strike
our allies, the Mori, from behind.

00:08:12.070 --> 00:08:17.030
Let's discern where Lord
Hideyoshi's path is headed for now.

00:08:19.620 --> 00:08:22.660
Tokugawa Ieyasu, taking the field now!

00:08:24.540 --> 00:08:27.700
My pawns, it does not
matter how many of you die!

00:08:27.790 --> 00:08:29.750
Slay every last one of our foes!

00:08:29.840 --> 00:08:32.550
To think he is willing from
the start to sacrifice his own!

00:08:32.630 --> 00:08:35.470
No matter what noble cause one
may serve, that is unforgivable!

00:08:35.550 --> 00:08:37.380
Master Yukimura!

00:08:41.180 --> 00:08:42.800
No!

00:08:51.030 --> 00:08:52.520
Foolishness.

00:08:52.610 --> 00:08:57.780
Surely, he does not think to stop
the Sun with only his two spears.

00:08:57.870 --> 00:09:00.650
A crude plan if there ever was one.

00:09:02.580 --> 00:09:04.740
Unrivaled Spear of World Domination!

00:09:04.830 --> 00:09:08.290
Sanada Yukimura is here!

00:09:08.380 --> 00:09:11.040
I will stop it!

00:09:15.840 --> 00:09:19.300
My spirit surges!

00:09:22.640 --> 00:09:24.260
What... is this?

00:09:24.350 --> 00:09:28.720
They will not break!
The spears of my soul will not break!

00:09:31.020 --> 00:09:34.770
Do not break!

00:09:43.200 --> 00:09:45.320
He is a true sacrificial pawn.

00:09:45.410 --> 00:09:47.750
The ideal sacrificial pawn.

00:09:47.830 --> 00:09:51.750
I wish that I could make my own
sacrificial pawns learn from him.

00:09:51.840 --> 00:09:53.290
Mori Motonari!

00:09:53.380 --> 00:09:56.340
Come, let us have a fair fight!

00:09:56.420 --> 00:10:00.290
A sacrificial pawn should die
like one, in an unsightly manner!

00:10:01.760 --> 00:10:05.430
O Three Stars! My family crest!

00:10:05.520 --> 00:10:11.560
I respectfully offer it up to the sun!

00:10:11.650 --> 00:10:14.390
A sacrificial pawn cannot stop me!

00:10:14.480 --> 00:10:17.020
Start up the Day Star's Ray!

00:10:20.740 --> 00:10:23.900
It is hot!

00:10:23.990 --> 00:10:27.080
It is all in accordance with my calculations.

00:10:28.000 --> 00:10:29.910
I hate to say this,

00:10:30.000 --> 00:10:31.620
but I have no choice

00:10:31.710 --> 00:10:34.790
but to recognize that the dear
boy Masamune is a born dragon.

00:10:35.920 --> 00:10:38.960
Hideyoshi is stronger than anyone out there.

00:10:39.050 --> 00:10:41.130
But he...

00:10:46.680 --> 00:10:50.800
I sense something unfathomable in that Dragon.

00:10:52.650 --> 00:10:55.350
Someday, he is certain to become...

00:10:55.440 --> 00:10:58.400
...a force that will bring harm to the Toyotomi.

00:11:31.690 --> 00:11:34.520
Sweeping... through the skies...

00:11:34.610 --> 00:11:37.060
Scorching... the earth...

00:11:37.150 --> 00:11:42.520
Sanada Yukimura will never stand still!

00:11:43.070 --> 00:11:44.400
This man...

00:11:44.490 --> 00:11:46.230
To think he can burn so furiously,

00:11:46.330 --> 00:11:50.820
hotter than even the
incomparable searing heat of the sun!

00:11:52.170 --> 00:11:57.630
My soul shall never be extinguished!

00:12:00.300 --> 00:12:03.840
So he has... transcended my calculations?

00:12:06.100 --> 00:12:09.460
I, suffer defeat? Impossible!

00:12:23.070 --> 00:12:25.030
Lord Masamune,

00:12:25.120 --> 00:12:29.580
have I managed to become
more like you in some small way?

00:12:29.660 --> 00:12:31.490
Please live through this.

00:12:31.580 --> 00:12:34.570
And once more...

00:12:34.670 --> 00:12:38.410
Let us meet once more.

00:12:55.690 --> 00:12:58.520
Carving away at each other's
lives is exactly what I wanted,

00:12:58.610 --> 00:13:01.350
but if your life is nearly worn through already,

00:13:01.440 --> 00:13:04.480
you won't be able to defeat me.

00:13:04.570 --> 00:13:06.980
However, you'll get no mercy from me.

00:13:07.070 --> 00:13:09.230
That's as it should be.

00:13:18.170 --> 00:13:23.460
There was never anyone
who could take my place.

00:14:03.050 --> 00:14:04.660
Hideyoshi...

00:14:06.260 --> 00:14:08.960
The Dragon will devour even the gods.

00:14:09.050 --> 00:14:12.760
No one can stop Lord Masamune.

00:14:14.680 --> 00:14:18.170
What're you doing, staring off into space?

00:14:18.270 --> 00:14:21.260
Before you go gazing across the
sea that you can't even see from here,

00:14:21.360 --> 00:14:24.220
first, take a good look at
what's right under your nose.

00:14:24.320 --> 00:14:26.560
Stop howling from a distance.

00:14:26.650 --> 00:14:29.740
You have surely learned your
lesson and are feeling sorry already

00:14:29.820 --> 00:14:31.860
that you were foolish enough

00:14:31.950 --> 00:14:35.320
to defy a mighty power
without knowing your own place.

00:14:36.000 --> 00:14:39.740
To attempt to conquer this country
without knowing the broader aspects...

00:14:39.830 --> 00:14:42.870
Know that that in and of itself is conceited!

00:15:03.940 --> 00:15:07.560
This is the end of one who lacks strength.

00:15:34.510 --> 00:15:36.670
Why you...

00:15:36.760 --> 00:15:40.130
First, that pirate, and now you!
Why will you not fall?!

00:15:40.230 --> 00:15:45.600
Looks like getting spoiled by that
lackey of yours is hurting you now.

00:15:49.280 --> 00:15:50.890
No limit!

00:15:59.250 --> 00:16:03.330
I can't let you have this
country, even if it kills me.

00:16:03.420 --> 00:16:06.700
Are you saying that you will unify it then?

00:16:06.790 --> 00:16:10.250
Ultimately, you are nothing more
than the leader of a band of ruffians.

00:16:10.340 --> 00:16:13.250
What would you do with this country?!

00:16:13.340 --> 00:16:16.510
That, you'll have to wait and see to find out.

00:16:16.600 --> 00:16:17.930
Foolishness!

00:16:18.010 --> 00:16:19.970
Don't be so rigid in your thinking.

00:16:20.060 --> 00:16:22.420
As long as you know what needs protecting,

00:16:22.520 --> 00:16:24.980
most things work themselves out.

00:16:25.060 --> 00:16:27.100
You see?

00:16:27.190 --> 00:16:29.400
Under no circumstances

00:16:29.480 --> 00:16:32.730
will I ever hand over this
country to the likes of you!

00:16:32.820 --> 00:16:36.560
Number One of Oshu, Date Masamune,

00:16:36.660 --> 00:16:38.270
pressing on!

00:16:58.010 --> 00:16:59.630
Blast off!

00:17:08.560 --> 00:17:11.270
Now, I can finally head on out...

00:17:11.360 --> 00:17:14.570
...to the party that's
been on hold thanks to you.

00:17:14.650 --> 00:17:17.900
The party that I've been looking forward to.

00:17:26.460 --> 00:17:28.070
Hideyoshi...

00:17:33.840 --> 00:17:38.300
Remember how we used to enjoy
the breeze like this together a lot?

00:17:38.390 --> 00:17:40.250
It's like we've gone back to those days again.

00:17:40.350 --> 00:17:41.960
Don't you think, Hideyoshi?

00:17:43.020 --> 00:17:46.140
Time flows at a leisurely pace here.

00:17:49.150 --> 00:17:53.690
This may be the first time
I've enjoyed the breeze like this.

00:17:53.780 --> 00:17:56.730
It's been a long time since the
three of us have been together.

00:17:56.820 --> 00:17:59.230
It's really been a long time.

00:17:59.320 --> 00:18:03.240
Oh, yeah, Hideyoshi, you used to
like going to see cherry blossoms, right?

00:18:03.330 --> 00:18:05.410
When spring comes around,
let's go together again and--

00:18:05.500 --> 00:18:06.330
Keiji.

00:18:06.410 --> 00:18:07.240
Huh?

00:18:07.330 --> 00:18:11.700
People cannot live forever as you do.

00:18:11.790 --> 00:18:17.660
In order to lead all people
and build a truly strong nation,

00:18:17.760 --> 00:18:22.300
you absolutely cannot have
anything that could make you weak.

00:18:28.980 --> 00:18:33.640
Your little friend delivered this to me, but...

00:18:33.730 --> 00:18:37.730
I am not worthy of having it.

00:18:37.820 --> 00:18:42.560
Do me the favor of holding on to it for her,

00:18:42.660 --> 00:18:44.270
Keiji.

00:18:48.620 --> 00:18:50.410
Is that right?

00:18:50.500 --> 00:18:56.670
You big obstinate... fool.

00:19:05.850 --> 00:19:10.720
Soon, the Toyotomi Army fell apart.

00:19:10.810 --> 00:19:15.810
A general, who believed only in
strength and pursued it obstinately,

00:19:15.900 --> 00:19:19.770
and his friend and strategist,
who had faith in his aspirations...

00:19:19.860 --> 00:19:24.820
With literally overwhelming might,
they tried to unify the country

00:19:24.910 --> 00:19:28.150
and then make inroads out into the world.

00:19:28.250 --> 00:19:33.330
And now that era had come to an end.

00:19:35.210 --> 00:19:39.450
No one had yet laid claim to the
country of the land of the rising sun

00:19:39.550 --> 00:19:43.420
and until numerous blades rose
up in chaos yet again to fight for it,

00:19:43.510 --> 00:19:46.340
the people gave themselves
over to the fleeting peace

00:19:46.430 --> 00:19:49.170
that had spread across the country.

00:19:49.270 --> 00:19:51.260
And once more,

00:19:51.350 --> 00:19:54.970
they quietly waited for the
war cry aspiring to the pinnacle.

00:19:58.610 --> 00:20:01.100
Where are you going, Keiji?

00:20:01.200 --> 00:20:02.400
I'm making a quick trip to Kyoto.

00:20:02.490 --> 00:20:05.900
And then I'm thinking about extending
my trip out to Motochika's place.

00:20:05.990 --> 00:20:08.650
But Keiji, you...

00:20:08.740 --> 00:20:09.870
You are to become a warrior

00:20:09.950 --> 00:20:12.070
and succeed as the head of the Maeda family.

00:20:12.160 --> 00:20:14.450
That is what you said
you would do just recently.

00:20:14.540 --> 00:20:17.160
Huh? Did I say that?

00:20:18.550 --> 00:20:20.540
Keiji?!

00:20:20.630 --> 00:20:22.540
Well, see you later!

00:20:23.050 --> 00:20:25.260
Keiji!

00:20:25.340 --> 00:20:27.260
Honestly! What a child you are!

00:20:27.350 --> 00:20:29.510
There are lies that you may
tell and lies that you may not!

00:20:29.600 --> 00:20:32.340
Matsu! Sis! Keep up that look of disapproval

00:20:32.440 --> 00:20:34.220
and you'll get wrinkles between your brows!

00:20:34.310 --> 00:20:35.050
What?!

00:20:35.100 --> 00:20:36.510
Ooh!

00:20:36.610 --> 00:20:38.020
See here now, Keiji!

00:20:38.110 --> 00:20:39.470
Hold it right there!

00:20:39.570 --> 00:20:42.150
--There are things that
should and should not be said!
--That's dangerous!

00:20:42.240 --> 00:20:45.570
My lord Inuchiyo, this is no laughing matter!

00:20:45.660 --> 00:20:47.910
Hold it right there, Keiji!

00:20:51.660 --> 00:20:54.320
The world is full of struggles.

00:20:54.420 --> 00:20:56.160
Though the world may cease to war,

00:20:56.250 --> 00:20:58.710
people will continue to have to struggle.

00:20:58.790 --> 00:21:01.460
Though a day may come
when you lay your spears to rest,

00:21:01.550 --> 00:21:02.960
for as long as you live,

00:21:03.050 --> 00:21:07.670
continue to wield the spears of
your soul for what you believe in.

00:21:07.760 --> 00:21:08.550
Yes, Sir!

00:21:08.600 --> 00:21:11.880
In order to forge a world where
all may live, not for war and strife,

00:21:11.970 --> 00:21:14.350
but to work hard for fruitful lives

00:21:14.440 --> 00:21:17.850
and ultimately, to have a
world we can sincerely extol...

00:21:17.940 --> 00:21:21.520
And to that end, I, Yukimura,
shall endure injustices, overcome trials,

00:21:21.610 --> 00:21:23.900
and accept contradictions
within none other than myself.

00:21:23.990 --> 00:21:26.400
That is how I have resolved to live my life!

00:21:26.490 --> 00:21:28.030
Until that day comes,

00:21:28.120 --> 00:21:30.570
I intend to let my soul burn and seethe,

00:21:30.660 --> 00:21:34.030
and accomplish all that
my life allows, without fail!

00:21:37.120 --> 00:21:41.410
Perhaps the role of the
elderly is over already...

00:21:43.800 --> 00:21:45.000
My lord!

00:21:45.090 --> 00:21:47.080
M-My lord!

00:21:47.180 --> 00:21:51.640
Did you think that I would
utter such feeble words?!

00:21:56.520 --> 00:21:59.480
How you have grown, Yukimura!

00:21:59.560 --> 00:22:02.430
My lord!

00:22:02.530 --> 00:22:06.860
--Yukimura!
--My lord!

00:22:06.950 --> 00:22:09.150
Yukimura!

00:22:09.240 --> 00:22:10.030
My lord!

00:22:10.700 --> 00:22:13.030
Yukimura!

00:22:16.710 --> 00:22:18.320
Good grief.

00:22:35.600 --> 00:22:39.840
Someone will be starting up a party soon.

00:22:39.940 --> 00:22:40.890
We will surely be living in a
time of war again presently.

00:22:42.980 --> 00:22:45.440
We must rebuild Oshu before then.

00:22:45.900 --> 00:22:46.690
Yeah.

00:22:46.740 --> 00:22:48.230
Looks like there won't be any time to be bored.

00:22:49.160 --> 00:22:51.150
We've also gained a spirited
bunch to add to our roster.

00:22:52.530 --> 00:22:53.820
They seem to be impatient to raise a war cry.

00:22:55.080 --> 00:22:56.580
Excellent.

00:22:56.660 --> 00:22:59.830
We'll have to let them see the
country under the Dragon's rule.

00:22:59.920 --> 00:23:01.170
Yes, Sir.

00:23:01.250 --> 00:23:01.830
Until that day,

00:23:02.750 --> 00:23:05.120
I'll be entrusting my back to you again.

00:23:05.210 --> 00:23:07.790
You ready for it, Kojuro?

00:23:07.920 --> 00:23:09.830
You need not even ask.

00:23:09.930 --> 00:23:10.760
Good answer.

00:23:14.680 --> 00:23:16.140
Are you ready, guys?!

